**/xcuserdata
**/xcshareddata
**/.vscode/**
**/*-diff.html

# Claude Code harness state (per-developer scheduled-task locks, local
# settings overrides) stays local. Skills under .claude/skills/ are
# versioned guidance, like CLAUDE.md at the repo root, so they are
# re-included below. Ignoring .claude/* (not .claude/) is what lets the
# negation work: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# itself excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

**/TestResults

# LLVM coverage profile output (emitted by -profile-generate builds, e.g.
# code-coverage-enabled test runs).
*.profraw